      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TORNADO CHEVY (1) goes very well this course and distance starting 11 times for seven wins and two minors. Below best last time at this track (17.72) in a Grade 4, finishing a 4 length fifth. Looks suited here and rates on top. NOIR (7) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at Richmond over 320m behind Ace To Burn (19.06) in a Grade 4/5. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Should be in this for a long way. REALLY SAVAGE (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.58) at this track behind Jack's Doubled in a Grade 4. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Must be included in calculations.",
